it_Cordrane.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cordrane\" title=\"Cordrane\">Cordrane</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>CORDRANE,\n</p><p><br>\nBe advised NOT to take any heed of the complaints we've received regarding your zomblings and spells. Business is business  - the paranoid and rich Baldurians won't complain. Let us hope the armies of the Absolute stick around through the next quarter.\n</p><p><br>\nMaster Lorroakan\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214151\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2103/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31943/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8094/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935283/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.218      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   59.218      1 -total\n 64.47%   38.180      9 Template:Icon_text\n 57.40%   33.989     21 Template:Trim\n 35.31%   20.908      1 Template:PageSeo\n 35.12%   20.798      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 32.35%   19.158      3 Template:CharLink\n 31.45%   18.625      4 Template:Icon_link\n 21.63%   12.809      9 Template:Ifempty\n 18.78%   11.123      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47078-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214151 and revision id 331650. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}